AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008811> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/uberon-basic#grouping_class>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0008811> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/uberon-basic#organ_slim>)
