AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#inSubset> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0010369> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/uberon/uberon-basic#human_reference_atlas>)
